          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Choose employable courses:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "51e5efd06c98",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Subjects like business, data science, nursing, IT, and engineering have higher job demand."
